5,1,1,talk,Servas,,I believe we should start by understanding the human element. I will look into the staffing rolls for technical posts and the minutes on secondments and crew strength.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,I think it is important to see where the costs are shifting. I will check the travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers and the national computing agreement and facility day rates.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to see how the shared tools are doing! I'll check the incident logs on shared instrumentation and the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"To ensure we aren't blindsided by systemic delays, I shall examine the portfolio review of schedule overruns and the station records from partner field sites.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I will examine the closeout files of finished awards and the national repository deposit turnaround.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,pass,Servas,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Benjamin, I think your focus on systemic delays is very prudent. I wonder if those overruns correlate with the cost shifts I am investigating.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I hope we find out that everything is running smoothly! @Midori, maybe the costs are higher because the tools are being used more?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, that is a possibility, though I suspect the delays may be more structural than simply a matter of high demand.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,We shall see if the historical data provides a clearer pattern than our current assumptions.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,It is often the case that the patterns of the past illuminate the path forward. I look forward to seeing how our findings intersect.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I agree, Servas. I hope we can find a balance that supports the researchers without overloading the system.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm just excited to get started! I bet we'll find some really cool things that help us pick the best project.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, Kenji. Though I suspect the ""cool things"" we find may be more cautionary than celebratory, the clarity will be invaluable.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,Precision is more valuable than optimism when the stakes are this high.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
